{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 43, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "\"Honestly, Brenda, are you *sure* this is necessary?\" Mark sighed, adjusting the drawstring of his sweatpants. He looked utterly out of place.\n\nBrenda, resplendent in a shimmering emerald green ball gown, smoothed down the train. \"Mark, darling, it's the annual Starlight Gala. It's *tradition*. And frankly, a bit of glamour is good for the soul.\" She offered him a dazzling smile.\n\nMark shifted uncomfortably. \"Tradition involving a ton of people in…formal wear? I feel like I’m attending a Renaissance fair, but with more sequins.\"\n\n\"Don't be ridiculous! It's just a fun night. Think of it as…a chance to meet people, network, and maybe even find a potential business partner. Besides,\" Brenda added, winking, \"you look dashing in those…comfortable pants.\"\n\n\"Comfortable is the operative word,\" Mark mumbled. \"I just…don't understand why I have to wear this ridiculous thing. I have a presentation tomorrow.\"\n\nBrenda chuckled. \"*It’s about making a good impression, Mark. People remember faces, not attire.*\" She gently tugged on his arm. \"Come on. Let's at least try to make a decent effort. Think of the free canapés!\"\n\n\"Free canapés are a strong motivator,\" Mark conceded, a small smile finally appearing. \"*And I’m sure there’s a comfortable corner where I can strategically position myself to observe the presentations without having to…mingle.*\"\n\n\"Excellent! I'll handle the socializing,\" Brenda said, already gliding towards the door. \"You just focus on not spilling anything on yourself. *And try to smile! It really does help.*\"\n\nMark followed her out, still slightly bewildered. \"Right. Smile. And avoid the canapés. That’s the plan.\"\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -0.6658610701560974}, {"token": "Honestly", "logprob": -0.15644153952598572}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.00032240914879366755}, {"token": "▁Brenda", "